 "アクセシング": "معبر, منفذ (A way or means of approaching or entering; an entrance; a passage.) / دخول, ولوج (The act of approaching or entering; an advance.) / حق ولوج (The right or ability of approaching or entering; admittance; admission; accessib) / وَلَجَ, ذلف (To gain or obtain access to.)  [accessing]",
 "アクセス": "معبر, منفذ (A way or means of approaching or entering; an entrance; a passage.) / دخول, ولوج (The act of approaching or entering; an advance.) / حق ولوج (The right or ability of approaching or entering; admittance; admission; accessib) / وَلَجَ, ذلف (To gain or obtain access to.)  [access (to a place, esp. using public transport)]\nمثال: 空港へのアクセスがいいところに泊まろうよ。\n→ Let's stay somewhere with easy airport access. / معبر, منفذ (A way or means of approaching or entering; an entrance; a passage.) / دخول, ولوج (The act of approaching or entering; an advance.) / حق ولوج (The right or ability of approaching or entering; admittance; admission; accessib) / وَلَجَ, ذلف (To gain or obtain access to.)  [access (to a website, data, etc.)]\nمثال: どういうわけかメールにアクセスできませんでした。\n→ For some reason I couldn't access my e-mail.",
