 "アクセッシング": "معبر, منفذ (A way or means of approaching or entering; an entrance; a passage.) / دخول, ولوج (The act of approaching or entering; an advance.) / حق ولوج (The right or ability of approaching or entering; admittance; admission; accessib) / وَلَجَ, ذلف (To gain or obtain access to.)  [accessing]",
