 "アグレシブ": "عُدْوَانِيّ (tending or disposed to aggress) / هُجُومِيّ (tending or disposed to aggress)  [aggressive]\nمثال: 内面を理解して貰うためのアピールも必要なのさ！ボクのアグレッシブな行動もその中の一つ！\n→ I also need to get people to understand the real me! My forceful behaviour is one way I try to do this!",
