 "アゲる": "رَفَعَ (to cause to rise)  [to raise]\nمثال: 両手をあげろ！\n→ Hands up! / [to move something (to a higher place) ; to put onto (e.g. a shelf)]\nمثال: これ荷物を上にあげてもよろしい。\n→ Can I put this up for you? / زَاد (To make (a quantity, etc.) larger.) / زِيَادَة (An amount by which a quantity is increased.) / اِرْتِفَاع, اِزْدِيَاد (For a quantity, the act or process of becoming larger.)  [to increase (price, quality, status, etc.)]\nocc. 騰げる in ref. to price\nمثال: 彼は給料をすぐにあげてくれと要求した。\n→ He demanded that his salary should be increased right away. / [to show someone (into a room) ; to let in (e.g. a guest)]",
